{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/4ae3a5254d14cb12803c9ac96657af8b.poster.avif?t=1770399860\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/4ae3a5254d14cb12803c9ac96657af8b.webm?t=1770399860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/4ae3a5254d14cb12803c9ac96657af8b.mp4?t=1770399860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Terrain is an animal adventure where you play as a wild boar searching for your missing piglets. Explore a vibrant natural world and experience the life of a wild animal in a wholesome, playful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your strength to smash, toss and forage through the environment. Charge through obstacles, knock over trash bins for food, and uncover secrets hidden across the land.<strong> </strong> <br>  <br>\ud83d\udc17\u00a0<u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Life</strong> - Be a wild boar, living freely and causing chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piglets -\u00a0</strong>Find and rescue your lost piglets, then travel, play and interact with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playful Chaos -\u00a0</strong>Knock over trash bins, smash objects, and reshape the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals</strong> - Make friends with foxes, frogs, deer, ants, and more along your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop Anywhere -\u00a0</strong>Eat food to charge your poop and grow new plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewilding -</strong> Use mushrooms to heal toxic areas and restore natural balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Natural World</strong> - Explore a lively world full of surprises at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruit Hats</strong> - Wear silly hats, gain weight, and customize your appearance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the forest recover by using mushrooms to heal toxic areas, and poop new flowers to rewild nature. Reunite with your piglets, travel together, and become a part of the living symbiosis between animals, plants and mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/7bd7cc4fe943a5858eb10ee67495e76f.poster.avif?t=1770399860\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/7bd7cc4fe943a5858eb10ee67495e76f.webm?t=1770399860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/7bd7cc4fe943a5858eb10ee67495e76f.mp4?t=1770399860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301300?t=1770399860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301300?t=1770399860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/ef3493939a39bd1a24b7540bc4635434298ffc1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770399860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/ef3493939a39bd1a24b7540bc4635434298ffc1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770399860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","i